      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "If you are implementing your own container view controller, it must call the [`willMove(toParent:)`](uiviewcontroller/willmove(toparent:).md) method of the child view controller before calling the [`removeFromParent()`](uiviewcontroller/removefromparent().md) method, passing in a parent value of `nil`.",
